## Police Involvement

On {{date reported to police}}, I reported the Respondent's conduct to the police.

The crime reference number provided was: {{police reference}}

The outcome was: {{police action or advice received}}

## Impact Upon Me

The Respondent's behaviour has had a profound impact on my wellbeing.

As a consequence, I have experienced {{effect on the client}}, and/or other emotional effects.

I remain fearful of the Respondent and his behaviour.

I am concerned about what the Respondent may do next if the Court does not intervene.

I wish to live my life free from abuse, harassment and intimidation.

## Special measures

I respectfully request that the following special measures be made available for any Court hearing:

- Screens within the courtroom;
- Separate waiting areas;
- Separate entrances and exits where available;
- Video-link participation where appropriate;
- Any other special measures the Court considers necessary.

## Without Notice Application

I respectfully request that the Court make a Non-Molestation Order.

I request that the application be determined on a without notice basis pursuant to Section 45 of the Family Law Act 1996.

I believe there is a significant risk of harm if the Respondent becomes aware of this application before an Order is made. In particular:

- The Respondent's behaviour is unpredictable;
- The Respondent has a history of harassment and intimidation;
- There is a risk the Respondent will attempt to contact me;
- There is a risk the Respondent will escalate his behaviour;
- There is a risk the Respondent will seek to pressure me into withdrawing the application.

I therefore respectfully ask the Court to grant the Non-Molestation Order without notice so that immediate protection can be provided.

## Statement of Truth

I believe that the facts stated in this witness statement are true.

I understand that proceedings for contempt of court may be brought against anyone who makes, or causes to be made, a false statement in a document verified by a statement of truth without an honest belief in its truth.

